      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T11:14:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I setup a new gerrit site with this version and tried the following permissions in All-Projects:\n\n```\n[access \"refs/*\"]\n\tread \u003d group Administrators\n\tread \u003d block group Blocked Users\n\tpostReviewComment \u003d group Registered Users\n\tpostReviewComment \u003d block group Untrusted Users\n[access \"refs/for/*\"]\n\taddPatchSet \u003d group Registered Users\n\tpush \u003d group Registered Users\n\tpushMerge \u003d group Registered Users\n[access \"refs/heads/*\"]\n\tcreate \u003d group Administrators\n\tcreate \u003d group Project Owners\n\teditTopicName \u003d +force group Administrators\n\teditTopicName \u003d +force group Project Owners\n\tforgeAuthor \u003d group Registered Users\n\tforgeCommitter \u003d group Administrators\n\tforgeCommitter \u003d group Project Owners\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -2..+2 group Administrators\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -2..+2 group Project Owners\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -1..+1 group Registered Users\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d block -1..+1 group Untrusted Users\n\tread \u003d group Anonymous Users\n\trevert \u003d group Administrators\n\trevert \u003d group Project Owners\n\tsubmit \u003d group Administrators\n\tsubmit \u003d group Project Owners\n[access \"refs/meta/config\"]\n\texclusiveGroupPermissions \u003d read\n\tcreate \u003d group Administrators\n\tcreate \u003d group Project Owners\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -2..+2 group Administrators\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -2..+2 group Project Owners\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -1..+1 group Registered Users\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d block -1..-1 group Untrusted Users\n\tread \u003d group Administrators\n\tread \u003d group Project Owners\n\tsubmit \u003d group Administrators\n\tsubmit \u003d group Project Owners\n[access \"refs/meta/version\"]\n\tread \u003d group Anonymous Users\n[access \"refs/tags/*\"]\n\tcreate \u003d group Administrators\n\tcreate \u003d group Project Owners\n\tcreateSignedTag \u003d group Administrators\n\tcreateSignedTag \u003d group Project Owners\n\tcreateTag \u003d group Administrators\n\tcreateTag \u003d group Project Owners\n```\n\nI created a user \"test\" and added it to the \"Untrusted Users\" group.\nThe site only has the default \"Code Review\" label.\n\nI blocked postReviewComment for \"Untrusted Users\"\n```\n[access \"refs/*\"]\n    postReviewComment \u003d block group Untrusted Users\n```\nand I blocked CodeReview for \"Untrusted Users\"\"\n```\n[access \"refs/heads/*\"]\n    label-Code-Review \u003d block -1..+1 group Untrusted Users\n[access \"refs/meta/config\"]\n    label-Code-Review \u003d block -1..+1 group Untrusted Users\n```\n\nThough the user \"test\" who is member of \"Untrusted Users\" still was able to post comments on a change owned by another user.",
      "parentUuid": "0fa4587a_6f31d2e5",
      "revId": "8426105fb380e5226a418a1ce98d62b53f80a92a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
