      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T21:57:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Your blocks aren\u0027t doing anything because they\u0027re in the [same access section as an allow](https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/access-control.html#__block_and_allow_rules_in_the_same_access_section).\n\nThe allows for `Registered Users` override the block here:\n```\n[access \"refs/*\"]\n\t....\n\tpostReviewComment \u003d group Registered Users  \u003c--- overrides\n\tpostReviewComment \u003d block group Untrusted Users\n```\n\nand here:\n```\n[access \"refs/heads/*\"]\n\t....\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d -1..+1 group Registered Users \u003c--- overrides\n\tlabel-Code-Review \u003d block -1..+1 group Untrusted Users\n```",
      "parentUuid": "3269068e_b96bd339",
      "revId": "8426105fb380e5226a418a1ce98d62b53f80a92a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
